    <h1 class="load-up d1" data-bm="Penjagaan kulit premium, <span class='hl'>ditembak seperti premium.</span>">Premium skincare, <span class="hl">shot like it.</span></h1>
    <p class="lead load-up d2" data-bm="Anaaka ialah jenama penjagaan kulit premium Halal dari Eropah. Kandungannya perlu memenuhi dua jangkaan sekaligus: kehalusan Eropah, dan kepercayaan Halal untuk pasaran Malaysia. Kami menggambarkannya dalam dua persekitaran &mdash; lokasi luar dan meja produk terkawal.">Anaaka is a European Halal premium skincare brand. Its content had to meet two expectations at once: European refinement, and Halal credibility for the Malaysian market. We shot it in two environments &mdash; an outdoor location and a controlled product table.</p>
