<!-- ===== 1. OVERVIEW ===== -->
<section class="section section--panel" id="overview">
  <div class="wrap split split--top">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow reveal" data-bm="Ringkasan">The brief</span>
      <h2 class="reveal" style="margin:1.1rem 0" data-bm="Dua jangkaan, satu penggambaran.">Two expectations, one shoot.</h2>
      <p class="reveal" style="margin-bottom:1rem" data-bm="Penjagaan kulit premium Halal Eropah ialah gabungan yang jarang. Jenama itu perlu kelihatan cukup halus untuk berdiri di sebelah jenama kecantikan Eropah, sambil bercakap dengan jujur kepada pembeli Malaysia yang mengambil berat tentang bahan dan pensijilan.">European Halal premium skincare is a rare combination. The brand had to look refined enough to sit beside European beauty labels, while speaking honestly to Malaysian buyers who care about ingredients and certification.</p>
      <p class="reveal" style="margin-bottom:1rem" data-bm="Cabaran produksi ialah nada. Terlalu klinikal, dan ia kehilangan kehangatan. Terlalu gaya hidup, dan produk hilang. Kami menyelesaikannya dengan memisahkan penggambaran kepada dua bahasa visual yang boleh dipotong bersama: cahaya siang semula jadi untuk jenama, dan cahaya terkawal untuk produk.">The production challenge was tone. Too clinical and it loses warmth. Too lifestyle and the product disappears. We solved it by splitting the shoot into two visual languages that could be cut together: natural daylight for the brand, controlled light for the product.</p>
      <p class="reveal muted" data-bm="Satu kru mengendalikan kedua-duanya, jadi gredasi, susunan dan nada kekal berterusan merentasi setiap penyerahan.">One crew handled both, so the grade, the styling and the tone stay continuous across every deliverable.</p>
      <div class="chip-row reveal" style="margin-top:1.8rem">
        <span class="chip chip--ghost" data-bm="Penjagaan kulit">Skincare</span>
        <span class="chip chip--ghost" data-bm="Halal premium">Halal premium</span>
        <span class="chip chip--ghost" data-bm="Jenama Eropah">European brand</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="split__media split__media--wide reveal">
      <span class="frame" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <img src="assets/img/anaaka-b-1.jpg" alt="Model holding an Anaaka premium skincare product during the commercial shoot" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="wrap" style="margin-top:4rem">
    <div class="section-head reveal" style="margin-bottom:2rem">
      <span class="eyebrow" data-bm="Bagaimana penggambaran berjalan">How the shoot ran</span>
      <h2 data-bm="Empat peringkat, satu bahasa visual.">Four stages, one visual language.</h2>
    </div>
    <ol class="step-list step-list--2">
      <li class="step-list__item reveal">
        <h3 data-bm="Pra-produksi &amp; arah seni">Pre-production &amp; art direction</h3>
        <p data-bm="Papan mood, palet dan senarai syot dipersetujui terlebih dahulu &mdash; termasuk keputusan susunan dan penggayaan yang menjaga kredibiliti jenama.">Mood boards, palette and shot list agreed up front &mdash; including the styling and wardrobe decisions that protect the brand's credibility.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="step-list__item reveal">
        <h3 data-bm="Hari lokasi">Location day</h3>
        <p data-bm="Penggambaran luar dengan kru penuh, menggunakan cahaya siang semula jadi untuk babak jenama dan gaya hidup.">An outdoor shoot with the full crew, using natural daylight for the brand and lifestyle sequences.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="step-list__item reveal">
        <h3 data-bm="Meja produk">The product table</h3>
        <p data-bm="Persekitaran terkawal untuk syot pek: tekstur, botol, dan detail label yang perlu boleh dibaca pada saiz kecil.">A controlled environment for pack shots: texture, bottle and label detail that has to stay readable at small sizes.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="step-list__item reveal">
        <h3 data-bm="Pasca &amp; gredasi">Post &amp; grade</h3>
        <p data-bm="Satu gredasi merentasi kedua-dua persekitaran, kemudian potongan komersial ditambah versi menegak untuk sosial.">A single grade across both environments, then the commercial cut plus vertical versions for social.</p>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ===== 2. ON LOCATION — showcase ===== -->
<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head reveal" style="margin-bottom:2.8rem">
      <span class="eyebrow" data-bm="01 &middot; Di lokasi">01 &middot; On location</span>
      <h2 data-bm="Cahaya semula jadi, kru penuh.">Natural light, full crew.</h2>
      <p class="lead muted" data-bm="Babak jenama digambarkan di luar, di mana cahaya bergerak dan tiada apa yang boleh diulang dengan tepat. Itu sebabnya perancangan dilakukan sebelum matahari, bukan selepasnya.">The brand sequences were shot outdoors, where the light moves and nothing repeats exactly. That is why the planning happens ahead of the sun, not after it.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="showcase reveal">
      <div class="showcase__media">
        <img src="assets/img/anaaka-2.jpg" alt="Outdoor commercial shoot in progress for Anaaka skincare with the crew on location" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1400" height="787">
      </div>
      <div class="showcase__card">
        <span class="chip" data-bm="Filem komersial">Commercial film</span>
        <h3 data-bm="Kehangatan tanpa kehilangan produk.">Warmth without losing the product.</h3>
        <p data-bm="Setiap syot gaya hidup dirangka supaya produk kekal dalam bingkai dan boleh dikenali &mdash; walaupun ia tidak menjadi subjek. Itu membuatkan potongan akhir terasa seperti cerita jenama, bukan katalog.">Every lifestyle shot is framed so the product stays in frame and recognisable &mdash; even when it is not the subject. That makes the final cut feel like a brand story rather than a catalogue.</p>
        <a class="btn btn--ghost" style="margin-top:1.4rem" href="services.html" data-bm="Perkhidmatan komersial kami <span class='arrow'>&rarr;</span>">Our commercial services <span class="arrow">&rarr;</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ===== 3. THE PRODUCT TABLE ===== -->
<section class="section section--panel">
  <div class="wrap split split--center split--rev">
    <div class="split__media split__media--square reveal">
      <span class="frame" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <img src="assets/img/anaaka-c-1.jpg" alt="Anaaka skincare products styled on a controlled product photography set-up" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
    </div>
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow reveal" data-bm="02 &middot; Meja produk">02 &middot; The product table</span>
      <h2 class="reveal" style="margin:1.1rem 0" data-bm="Botol tidak memaafkan pencahayaan yang malas.">Bottles do not forgive lazy lighting.</h2>
      <p class="reveal" style="margin-bottom:1rem" data-bm="Penjagaan kulit ialah kaca, plastik berkilat dan label kecil &mdash; tiga perkara yang menangkap setiap pantulan di dalam bilik. Meja produk dibina supaya pantulan menjadi keputusan, bukan kemalangan.">Skincare is glass, gloss and small type &mdash; three things that catch every reflection in the room. The product table is built so the reflections become a decision rather than an accident.</p>
      <p class="reveal" style="margin-bottom:1rem" data-bm="Kami menggambarkan setiap SKU dalam bingkai yang sama supaya kedai dalam talian, sekatan sosial dan bahan runcit boleh menggunakan set imej yang konsisten tanpa penggambaran semula.">We shoot every SKU in the same frame so the online store, the social grid and retail material can all draw from one consistent image set without a reshoot.</p>
      <p class="reveal muted" data-bm="Hasilnya: syot pek yang masih boleh dibaca pada saiz jari ibu &mdash; tempat kebanyakan pembeli benar-benar melihatnya.">The result: pack shots that still read at thumbnail size &mdash; which is where most buyers actually see them.</p>
      <div class="chip-row reveal" style="margin-top:1.8rem">
        <span class="chip chip--ghost" data-bm="Syot pek">Pack shots</span>
        <span class="chip chip--ghost" data-bm="Tekstur &amp; detail">Texture &amp; detail</span>
        <span class="chip chip--ghost" data-bm="Sedia e-dagang">E-commerce ready</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

